---
interface Props {
  whatsappNumber?: string;
  maxSpots?: number;
  backgroundImage?: string;
}

const {
  whatsappNumber = "3773364103",
  maxSpots = 30,
  backgroundImage = "/images/gym-preview.jpg",
} = Astro.props;

const whatsappUrl = `https://wa.me/39${whatsappNumber}?text=${encodeURIComponent(
  "Ciao! Vorrei maggiori informazioni sulle ultime tessere Foundation Member con il 35% di sconto prima dell'apertura del 10 Ottobre."
)}`;
---

<section class="hero-editorial">
  <div class="hero-bg-layer" style={`background-image: url('${backgroundImage}');`}></div>
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="top-line"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <!-- Meta Status Bar -->
    <div class="meta-bar">
      <div class="meta-label">
        <span class="dot-live"></span>
        <span>Apertura 10 Ottobre • Trissino (VI)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="scarcity-counter">
        <span class="badge-mini-soldout">1ª Tranche Sold Out</span>
        <span class="counter-text">Ultime <strong>{maxSpots} Tessere (-35%)</strong></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Grid -->
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-main">
       

        <h1 class="headline">
          Non ti manca <br class="mobile-hidden" />la volontà. <br />
          <span class="text-accent">Ti manca qualcuno <br class="mobile-hidden" />che ti aspetti.</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="usp-row">
          <span class="tag">1 Trainer ogni 10 Persone</span>
          <span class="divider">/</span>
          <span class="tag">Solo su Appuntamento</span>
          <span class="divider">/</span>
          <span class="tag">Zero Improvvisazione</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-aside">
        <p class="manifesto">
          Nelle palestre sovraffollate se molli non se ne accorge nessuno.  
          In Ethos hai un <strong>posto riservato</strong> e un <strong>Personal Trainer dedicato</strong> che ti conosce per nome, corregge ogni ripetizione e ti porta al risultato.
        </p>

        <div class="offer-box">
          <div class="offer-header">
            <span class="offer-badge">Seconda Tranche</span>
            <span class="discount-pill">-35% QUOTA LANCIO</span>
          </div>

          <div class="offer-statement">
            <h2 class="offer-highlight-title">Ultime 30 Tessere Foundation</h2>
            <p class="offer-desc">
              I primi 30 posti sono andati esauriti prima dell'apertura. Blocca la tua quota agevolata entro il <strong>9 Ottobre ore 23:59</strong>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="actions">
            <a href="#preiscrizione" class="btn btn-solid">
              Blocca la Tua Tessera al -35%
            </a>
            <a href={whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline">
              Richiedi Info su WhatsApp
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Value Stats -->
    <div class="stats-strip">
      <div class="stat-col">
        <span class="stat-num">01</span>
        <div class="stat-info">
          <strong>Rapporto 1 a 10 Reale</strong>
          <span>Un coach costantemente al tuo fianco per 60 minuti</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-col">
        <span class="stat-num">02</span>
        <div class="stat-info">
          <strong>Zero Schede Fotocopia</strong>
          <span>Esercizi e carichi calibrati sulla tua biomeccanica</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-col">
        <span class="stat-num">03</span>
        <div class="stat-info">
          <strong>Solo su Appuntamento</strong>
          <span>La tua postazione è pronta quando entri. Zero code</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .hero-editorial {
    position: relative;
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-bg-layer {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(110%);
    opacity: 0.16;
    z-index: 1;
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }
  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 75% 30%, rgba(0, 79, 91, 0.28) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88) 60%, #000000 100%);
    z-index: 2;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .top-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: #069892;
    z-index: 10;
  }
  .container {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
    z-index: 5;
  }
  .meta-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .meta-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    color: #a3a3a3;
  }
  .dot-live {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    background-color: #069892;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px #069892;
  }
  .scarcity-counter {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    color: #8c8c8c;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .badge-mini-soldout {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    padding: 0.18rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .counter-text strong {
    color: #069892;
    margin-left: 0.25rem;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
  }

  .hook-kicker {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    background: rgba(6, 152, 146, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(6, 152, 146, 0.35);
    color: #069892;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .hook-icon {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .headline {
    font-family: 'Michroma', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem 0;
  }
  .text-accent { 
    color: #069892; 
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(6, 152, 146, 0.25);
  }
  .usp-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    color: #a3a3a3;
  }
  .divider { color: #004f5b; }

  .manifesto {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #b8b8b8;
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
    border-left: 2px solid #069892;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }
  .manifesto strong { color: #ffffff; }

  .offer-box {
    background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.95);
    border: 1px solid rgba(6, 152, 146, 0.4);
    border-left: 3px solid #069892;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }
  .offer-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .offer-badge {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #a3a3a3;
  }
  .discount-pill {
    background-color: #069892;
    color: #000000;
    font-family: 'Michroma', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 0.2rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .offer-statement {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .offer-highlight-title {
    font-family: 'Michroma', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .offer-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #999999;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .offer-desc strong { color: #ffffff; }

  .actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.65rem; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn-solid { 
    background-color: #069892; 
    color: #000000; 
    border: 1px solid #069892; 
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .btn-solid:hover { 
    background-color: #05807a; 
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(6, 152, 146, 0.4);
  }
  .btn-outline { 
    background-color: transparent; 
    color: #ffffff; 
    border: 1px solid #292929; 
  }
  .btn-outline:hover { 
    border-color: #069892; 
    color: #069892; 
  }

  .stats-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding-top: 2.25rem;
  }
  .stat-col { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 1rem; }
  .stat-num { font-family: 'Michroma', sans-serif; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #069892; }
  .stat-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.2rem; }
  .stat-info strong { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #ffffff; }
  .stat-info span { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #737373; line-height: 1.4; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
    .stats-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .mobile-hidden { display: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .meta-bar { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .offer-box { padding: 1.35rem; }
  }
</style>